@startuml
!include style.iuml
' dpi only sets resolution; printed text size = fontSize * 72 * W_in / layout width.
skinparam dpi 120
' Communication diagram (UML 2.5): one link per pair of objects, every message on its link with a direction arrow
' (U+25B2 up, U+25BC down, U+25C4 left, U+25BA right), sequence numbers, guards in [..] and return values as "x := op()".
' Flow: a violation reaches the live monitor; an invigilator's action (2) makes the page send a warning (2.1) or a force-submit (2.2);
' the WPF client (no SignalR) picks the answer up from its next heartbeat ack (3)
' and passes it on to its views (4, 4.1). Decimal numbering
' (UML 2.5.1 Cl. 17.9): a message sent in reaction to message n is n.1, n.2, ...
' Sources: Views/ExamWindow.xaml.cs:43-46 (violationSink = LiveMonitoringService.ReportViolation),
' Services/Lockdown/LockdownCoordinator.cs:150-169, Services/LiveMonitoringService.cs:137-149,299-331,340-448,
' Views/ExamDashboard.xaml.cs:39-41, Controllers/MonitoringController.cs (PushEventBatch :458, Heartbeat :81),
' Hubs/MonitoringHub.cs:94-210 (SendWarning, ForceSubmitSessionById, ForceSubmitAsync), Services/ExamAccessService.cs,
' Services/SubmissionService.cs (FinalizeAsync -> SessionFinalized via IHubContext), LiveMonitorPage.tsx.
' Sized for includegraphics width linewidth (2091 px at dpi 120 and 20 pt: about 7.2 pt printed). SubmissionService sits left of
' MonitoringHub so the HUB-SUB and SUB-WEB links take separate routes; 2.2.4.2 is a head label at the SUB end of its link.
skinparam defaultFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowFontSize 24
skinparam nodesep 14
skinparam ranksep 44
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F2F2F2
}

actor "Teacher /\nInvigilator" as STAFF
rectangle "<u>:LiveMonitorPage</u>\n(web panel)" as WEB
rectangle "<u>:MonitoringHub</u>" as HUB
rectangle "<u>:ExamAccessService</u>" as ACC
rectangle "<u>:SubmissionService</u>" as SUB
rectangle "<u>:MonitoringController</u>" as CTRL
rectangle "<u>:AppDbContext</u>\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
rectangle "<u>:LockdownCoordinator</u>\n(WPF)" as LOCK
rectangle "<u>:LiveMonitoringService</u>\n(WPF)" as LMS
rectangle "<u>:ExamDashboard</u>\n(WPF)" as EDB
rectangle "<u>:ExamWindow</u>\n(WPF)" as WIN

STAFF -down- WEB : <U+25BC> 2: warn /\nforce submit
WEB -down- HUB : <U+25BC> 2.1 [warn]: SendWarning(\nstudentId, message)\n<U+25BC> 2.2 [force]: ForceSubmit\nSessionById(sessionId)\n<U+25B2> 2.1.4: ProctorWarningSent
SUB -right- HUB : <U+00A0><U+00A0><U+00A0><U+00A0><U+00A0><U+00A0><U+25C4> 2.2.4 [access != None]:\nFinalizeAsync(session,\nForceSubmitted)
HUB -down- ACC : <U+25BC> 2.1.2, 2.2.2: access :=\nGetAsync(user, examId)
HUB ---- DB : <U+25BC> 2.1.1, 2.2.1: find the\nInProgress session\n<U+25BC> 2.1.3 [access != None]:\nNotifications.Add(Warning),\naudit PROCTOR_\nWARNING_SENT,\nSaveChanges()\n<U+25BC> 2.2.3 [access != None]:\naudit SESSION_FORCE_\nSUBMITTED (staged)
SUB ---- DB : <U+25BC> 2.2.4.1: Status =\nForceSubmitted, receipt,\nSaveChanges()
WEB -down- "<U+25B2> 2.2.4.2: Session\nFinalized (IHubContext)" SUB
LMS -down- LOCK : <U+25B2> 1: ReportViolation(\nreason, detail)
LMS -up- CTRL : <U+25B2> 1.1: POST /api/monitoring/\nevents/batch (spooled)\n<U+25B2> 3: ack := POST /api/\nmonitoring/heartbeat\n(every 10 s)
CTRL -up- WEB : <U+25B2> 1.1.2: ViolationEvent\n(IHubContext, group\nexam:{examId})
CTRL ---- DB : <U+25BC> 1.1.1: MonitoringEvents\n.Add, SaveChanges(),\naudit MONITORING_\nVIOLATION\n<U+25BC> 3.1: unread Warning\nNotifications,\nsession Status
LMS -down- EDB : <U+25BC> 4: WarningsReceived /\nSessionStatusUpdated
EDB -down- WIN : <U+25BC> 4.1: ShowProctorWarnings()\n/ OnServerSessionStatus()

HUB -[hidden]right- CTRL
ACC -[hidden]down- DB

note left of WIN
  ack = {warnings[], sessionStatus, ..}.
  A warning comes back in every ack
  until the student acknowledges it
  (PATCH /api/notifications/{id}/read).
end note
@enduml
